					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Keter cake story!</p> <p>This really draws out the horror of that article. It's not &quot;the world will be consumed by cake&quot;, but &quot;we have to fucking eat each and every one, entirely, every single day for the rest of eternity&quot;. I felt sick by the end of reading this.</p> <p>Also, a POV shift here: &quot;The man, 2886, and I&quot;. Unless there's another observer behind the glass, but that doesn't mesh with the POV up to that point.</p> 
				 	]]>
